Package: provenance-scrubber
Version: 0.4.0
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Vanguard Arts SRL <https://vanguardarts.vip/>
Depends: python3, python3-pil, python3-pyside6, python3-cbor2
Recommends: python3-flask, python3-requests
Homepage: https://github.com/VanguardArts/provenance-scrubber
Description: Detect and strip provenance metadata (C2PA/EXIF/XMP/IPTC) from images
 Batches images and removes embedded provenance signals — C2PA Content
 Credentials manifests, EXIF, XMP, IPTC and generator strings — with optional
 pixel-domain transforms that degrade invisible watermarks. Ships the
 provenance-scrubber CLI and the provenance-scrubber-gui desktop app.
